# Design System

Tokens live in `app/globals.css` via `@theme inline`. See `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`.

- Use `bg-surface`, `text-charcoal`, `text-navy`, `text-gold` — never hardcode hex
- Use utility classes: `section-padding`, `container-content`, `prose-narrow`, `eyebrow`
- Headlines: `font-display`; body: `font-body`
- Section rhythm: alternate `bg-surface`, `bg-surface-muted`, `bg-navy`
- Focus: `ring-2 ring-gold ring-offset-2 ring-offset-surface`
